        "description": "The glowing things of the scene (sh.effects.glow_* in maps/map6_s04/events.lua), up to capacity at once; each frame the grid is cleared and each adds its spots in slot order. A projected spot is (size >> 8) * (1 - depth * depth_scale / 4096) >> 4 pixels. point: a spot on a point turned with its owner (offset in its view), size from \"size\" growing by \"grow\" per frame up to size_max. bones: one spot per entry [bone, factor, strength, strength_max] on the skeleton (bone 0: its root, base_root; others at their translation times offset_scale, base_bone), size = base + swell * factor; the swell grows by \"grow\" and the strength by strength_step up to strength_max until the scene timer passes fade_after, then the swell shrinks by \"shrink\" and the strength fades to 0. ray: aimed from its owner at its target, \"spots\" random spots per frame (x = rand % width / x_divisor + sweep - width, the sweep advancing by \"sweep\"; y = rand % height / y_divisor + y_offset; size rand % size_range + size_min; strength rand % strength_range). flash: once the scene timer passes start_after, the sound and the pad rumble, then a spot at (x, y) of spot_size pixels growing by spot_speed (Q12) per frame, the speed growing by spot_speed_add. Numbers from the original (Q12 where fractional).",
